        "name": "Study Design",
        "instanceType": "InterventionalStudyDesign",
        "description": "Study design overview Study J6Z-MC-CD01 (CD01) is a Phase 2, randomized, open-label, active-controlled study to investigate FXR314 agonist LY4395089 co-administration with mirikizumab in adults with moderately to severely active CD. The study design of this ISA will be governed by the IIBD master protocol. Duration and study periods for this ISA The duration and study periods for this ISA will be governed by the IIBD master protocol. A schematic of the design specific to this ISA is presented in Section 1.2. Assessments, sample collections, and study drug administrations for this ISA will occur at the visits shown in the SoA (Section 1.3). Treatment groups This table summarizes the treatment groups under this ISA. Study Interventions in Study Period 1 Study Intervention in Study Period 2 LY4395089/mirikizumab co-administration Mirikizumab Active comparator: mirikizumab Randomization ratios and stratification factors Transition from Study Period 1 to Study Period 2 See the IIBD master protocol and study schema (Section 1.2).",
